          "speaker": "client",
          "text": "Hi [FREELANCER_NAME_001], that is reasonable. I’ll send you the list of R1 routes and screens that are built sufficiently for assessment.\nAfter the Upwork contract and the confidentiality/IP arrangements have been completed, we’ll grant named, read-only repo access and provide a staging URL. This will exclude production credentials and customer data.\nBefore granting access, please confirm that your proposed review deliverable will cover:\na Release 1 readiness recommendation\nprioritised blockers and findings supported by evidence\nrisks relating to security, architecture, performance and maintainability\nrecommended remediation with indicative effort\nclearly stated assumptions and anything excluded from the review\nFor now, please also give me either an indicative price range or a capped discovery allowance. Once you have examined the materials, you can confirm the final scope, fixed price and delivery date.",
