          "conversation_turn_index": 27,
          "speaker": "freelancer",
          "text": "The front-end Release 1 audit has now been completed. All materials are available in the shared Drive folder at [URL_001]:\n\n• BIQc Audit — Word — the seven-document report\n• BIQc Audit — Markdown source — identical content prepared for Anjali\n• working journal — the verification task list provided for reference\n\nPlease begin with 01\\_FOUNDER\\_SUMMARY. It is designed for a reader without a technical background and explains the recommendation, readiness by module, and cost. The remaining files provide supporting detail: 02 contains the complete findings register with file/line evidence and hours; 03 gives the remediation sequence; 04 is the evidence log; 05 addresses the scope and timeline question; and 06 states the assumptions and exclusions.\n\nThe headline conclusion is that I cannot recommend approving Release 1 for an external launch in its present condition. In addition, the scope you confirmed on Sunday—multi-user, instant revocation, Wallet—cannot fit within this week. Section 6 of the founder summary describes two viable paths forward.",
